 "response": {
  "text": "Haan, **₹2,000 ke andar men’s jeans** ke liye kaafi achhe options mil rahe hain. Mere hisaab se priority ye rahegi:\n\n### [Levi's 505 Straight Fit Men Mid Rise Jeans]()\n*₹1,899*\n\n### [Levi's Men's 511 Slim Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,279*\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men Straight Fit Blue Jeans]()\n*₹1,439*\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men Blue Mid Rise Straight Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,767.15*\n\n### [Flying Machine Men's Jackson Skinny Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,099*\n\n### [Flying Machine Men's Slim Tapered Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,196*\n\n### 🏆 Meri ranking\n\n**1. Levi's — Best overall** ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐  \nSale mein ₹1,600–₹1,900 ke aas-paas **513/505** jaise models mil rahe hain. Quality, stitching aur long-term durability ke liye meri first choice. [levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/straight-fit-jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**2. Pepe Jeans — Best value** ⭐⭐⭐⭐½  \n₹1,400–₹2,000 mein straight/slim fits mil rahe hain. Agar Levi's ka achha deal na mile, **Pepe Jeans** bahut strong choice hai. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**3. Flying Machine — Best budget** ⭐⭐⭐⭐  \n₹1,000–₹1,600 ke range mein options mil jaate hain. Daily/college wear ke liye paisa vasool. [magicpin.com](https://magicpin.com/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**4. Roadster — Best for trendy fits** ⭐⭐⭐⭐  \nGenerally ₹800–₹1,600 range mein; slim, tapered aur contemporary styles zyada milte hain. [magicpin.com](https://magicpin.com/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**5. Spykar — Stretch/comfort ke liye** ⭐⭐⭐⭐  \nDiscounts mein ₹1,500 ke aas-paas mil sakti hai; stretchy daily-wear denim ke liye achha option. [magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### Agar sirf **ek** leni ho:\n👉 **Levi's 505/513 Straight Fit** — ₹1,700–₹2,000 ke andar mil jaaye to **le lo**.  \n👉 Agar ₹1,500 ke aas-paas chahiye: **Pepe Jeans Straight Fit**.  \n👉 ₹1,200 ke aas-paas: **Flying Machine**.\n\n**Tip:** Aajkal skinny jeans se better **straight / slim-straight / relaxed-straight** fit zyada versatile hai.\n\nAgar tum mujhe **apni height + weight + waist size (e.g. 32) + jeans ka colour (blue/black)** bata do, main ₹2,000 ke andar **3–5 exact jeans models** choose karke bata sakta hoon jo tum par best lagenge.",
